---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { AUDIENCES, USE_CASES } from '~/data/site'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Audiences"
  description="Who you are in the Konneal story: the secretariat, the members, the technical committees, and the digital team — and what changes for each."
>
  <section class="border-b border-rule">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-12 pt-14 sm:px-8 sm:pt-16">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="tick"></span>Audiences</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-sans text-[2.1rem] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[2.7rem]">
        What are you, and how do you benefit?
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        A Konneal deployment serves four roles at once. Find yours below; each section links to the use cases that
        role lives in.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-rule">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-rule bg-rule md:grid-cols-2">
        {
          AUDIENCES.map((a) => (
            <article class="bg-surface p-7 sm:p-8" id={a.id}>
              <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-blue">You are…</p>
              <h2 class="mt-3 font-sans text-[1.35rem] font-semibold leading-snug">{a.who}</h2>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[0.9rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-faint">{a.stake}</p>
              <p class="mt-4 border-t border-rule pt-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">{a.benefit}</p>
              <p class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-faint">Your use cases</span>
                {a.useCases.map((id) => {
                  const uc = USE_CASES.find((u) => u.id === id)!
                  return (
                    <a href={`/use-cases/#${id}`} class="font-mono text-[0.78rem] text-blue hover:text-keyline">
                      {uc.name} →
                    </a>
                  )
                })}
              </p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ink-faint">
        The digital team may also want the
        <a href="/how-it-works/" class="text-blue underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-keyline"
          >machinery page</a
        >, and the secretariat the
        <a href="/get-started/" class="text-blue underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-keyline"
          >adoption paths</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8">
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm text-ink-faint">
        The capabilities catalog and the jobs list describe the same system from the other two directions:
        <a href="/features/" class="text-blue underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-keyline">Features</a>
        and
        <a href="/use-cases/" class="text-blue underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-keyline">Use cases</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
